=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Ayame} in the {z:Metalworks} at (K-7).
** If you have finished the {M:Treasures of Aht Urhgan Missions|Treasures of Aht Urhgan Missions|Treasures of Aht Urhgan Missions}, you may need to speak with her twice.
** Acquire a {i:Yagudo Drink|Yagudo Drink|4558} from the {z:Auction House}, or purchase one from a {p:Curio Vendor Moogle} if you have the appropriate rhapsody item.

>**Note: Once you have talked to Ayame, the quest will show up in your quest log, at this point you may switch to another job to complete the quest.**
* Travel to {z:Castle Oztroja}.
** You will **not** need the three passwords to enter the Altar Room.
* Head to the top floor where you have limited time to get past the gate before it closes.
** Do not head through the timed gate. The **???** you need will be in the H-shaped room before it.
* Look for a torch with a **???** on it at (H-8). Trade it a {i:Yagudo Drink|Yagudo Drink|4558} and Pop {m:Huu Xalmo the Savage}.
* He drops {i:Xalmo Feather|Xalmo Feather|1100}.
** There is a 3 minute cooldown between pops if needing multiple feathers.
* Trade the feather to {p:Ayame} for your {i:Temple Hose|Temple Hose|14215}.

